tls.createServer, wrong passphrase throws ERR_OSSL_BAD_DECRYPT error:1C800064:Provider routines::bad decrypt
https.createServer, no passphrase throws ERR_OSSL_BAD_DECRYPT error:1C800064:Provider routines::bad decrypt
tls.createServer, key for another cert throws ERR_OSSL_X509_KEY_VALUES_MISMATCH error:05800074:x509 certificate routines::key values mismatch
mTLS, a client cert the ca issued
  server secureConnection: protocol TLSv1.3, alpn false, servername localhost, authorized true, authorizationError null, peer good client <- jsh test client ca, encrypted true, cipher TLSv1.3 name/standardName/version true
  server cipher the client's: true
  client secureConnect: authorized true, alpn false
  client got "hello from tls"
